# predicate/

Core predicate evaluation engine for Riffle that defines items, predicates, loops, and pipelines forming a composable filtering and pattern-matching system. The engine processes items through sequences of loops (where predicates are OR-joined) composed into pipelines (where loops are AND-joined), with integrated caching and comprehensive type coercion.

## Dirs

- `dsl/` -- DSL parser, evaluator, loader, and compiler for `.pred` files
- `standard_lib/` -- Library of standard text, numeric, boolean, collection, and date predicates

## Files

- `predicate.ex` -- Core predicate definition, evaluation, and caching interface
- `item.ex` -- Item struct representing a data row being processed, with fields, tags, and metadata
- `pipeline.ex` -- Pipeline struct composing loops into AND-joined sequences
- `loop.ex` -- Loop struct composing predicates into OR-joined groups
- `resolver.ex` -- Resolution and hydration of predicate, loop, and pipeline references
- `pipeline_config.ex` -- Behavior defining the PipelineConfig contract for pipeline modules
- `registry.ex` -- GenServer-based registry for compiled and loaded predicate definitions
- `default_pipeline_config.ex` -- Default implementation of PipelineConfig behavior for DSL macros
- `cache.ex` -- ETS-based caching system for predicate evaluation results
- `coerce.ex` -- Strict type coercion for numeric and boolean values in comparisons
- `standard_lib.ex` -- High-level organization and documentation of standard predicate library
